 ## How it works
-WISE accelerates the visibility testing phase of isosurface extraction (such as Marching Cubes) by projecting geometry onto a "warped" plane rather than the final image plane. The core insight is that visibility is preserved between the image plane and the warped projection plane; if a primitive is occluded on the warped plane, it is occluded on the final image [S1, book].
